@startuml
[*] --> Not Logged In
Not Logged In --> Logging In : Login
Logging In --> Logged In : Successful Login
Logged In --> Logging Activities : Start Logging
Logged In --> Viewing Dashboard : View Dashboard
Logging Activities --> Logging Activities : Continue Logging
Logging Activities --> Viewing Dashboard : Stop Logging
Viewing Dashboard --> Logging Activities : Resume Logging
Viewing Dashboard --> Logging Out : Logout
Logging Out --> [*] : Logout Complete
@enduml
